# Core (`src/core/**`)

- **I8:** No `@codemirror/view`, no UI framework, no DOM globals (`document`/`window`/`HTMLElement`). Enforced by `scripts/check-core-purity.mjs`.
- No domain-specific identifiers — structure levels come only from `StructureSchema` (`SPEC.md` § 4).
- Pure TypeScript; unit-testable without a browser.
- One place enforces each invariant (**I6**). Do not add a second check of the same rule elsewhere.
